        `,actionSteps:["Telefoningizda tezkor javoblar (Saved replies) shablonini saqlab qo'ying.","O'z mijozlaringiz bilan har doim ovozli iliq xabarlar orqali muloqot qilib ko'ring."],quiz:[{question:"Mijoz narx so'raganda qanday yondashuv eng yaxshi samara beradi?",options:["Faqat bitta raqam yozib jim bo'lish","Samimiy salomlashib, mahsulotning unga beradigan foydasini tushuntirib, keyin narxni aytish","Javob bermaslik","Darhol qo'ng'iroq qilib urishish"],correctAnswer:1,explanation:"Mehr va samimiyat bilan foydasini tushuntirish mijozda ishonch uyg'otadi."}]}]},{id:"sotuv-psixologiyasi",title:"Sotuv Psixologiyasi va E'tirozlar bilan Ishlash",badge:"Praktik trening",level:"Barcha bosqichlar",duration:"2 soat 50 daqiqa",lessonsCount:3,color:"from-amber-500 to-rose-500",icon:"HeartHandshake",shortDesc:"'Qimmat', 'O'ylab ko'raman', 'Menga kerak emas' degan e'tirozlarga professional javob berish.",instructor:{name:"Barno Rahimova",role:"Biznes Kouch & Psixolog",image:"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580894732444-8ecded7900cd?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=300"},lessons:[{id:"l4-1",number:1,title:"'Qimmat' va 'O'ylab ko'raman' e'tirozlarini mehr bilan yengish",duration:"28 daqiqa",overview:"E'tiroz bu rad etish emas, balki mijozning qo'shimcha ma'lumotga ehtiyoji borligidir.",notes:`
